§ `ss 6(5), 7(6), 17(3), 18(2), 28(3), 33`

#ASSERT `the offence is arrestable` `running an unlicensed debt collection business`
#ASSERT `the offence is arrestable` `acting as an unapproved debt collector`
#ASSERT NOT `the offence is arrestable` `a regulated business collecting without a class licence`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine for a first offence` `holding out as a debt collection business without a licence` EQUALS 20000
